Z||000000||Archie||09-05-2001||09:29 PM||||Well we've come up with another reason that you shouldn't miss FieroRama.<P>NIFE & V-8 Archie have made arrangements to put you on TV.<P>We are happy to tell you that Bill Wildt and his Ladies of Motorsport will be taping a episode Of MotorSports Unlimited at our FieroRama.<P>Many will remember that a years or so ago Bill taped one of his programs at my shop. Bill's program will air about 3 weeks after the show and re-ran about every 12 weeks for the next 3 years. Motor Sports Unlimited airs on Cable in the Greater Chicago area and this program will have a total viewing to some 4.5 million viewers.<P>Get your car there and keep smiling, you may be a star.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/msu-5.JPG"> <P>Here you see a picture of 3 of the Ladies of Motorsport then there is Paul V, myself, and Bill on the right.<P>As you can see we are pulling out all the stops to make this THE ONE SHOW you'll talk about all year.<P>Archie<P>[This message has been edited by Archie (edited 09-05-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Archie (edited 09-05-2001).]||||reg||4
